      "widgets_values": [
        "For the target video, at 0.00 seconds into the target video, <Picture 1> (from [Shot 1]) is fully referenced.\n\nintegrated_multimodal_description: [Shot 1] Live-action, cinematic, an extreme-wide establishing shot holds the young Chinese woman shown in <Picture 1>, preserving her high bun, ivory-and-pale-gold sheer hanfu, and the long guqin lying flat on the table in front of her. She remains the only person and keeps the same playing pose: gaze on the strings, right fingertips pluck one note then the next, left hand stays on the soundboard. The instrument never leaves the table. Hanging white and red silk banners billow. Mist rolls down the waterfall and cliff pavilions. Then a sudden shaft of intense gold light flares through the mist above the falls, washing the silk, the pond, and her sleeves. The camera pulls out with large amplitude at slow speed, revealing more of the cliff palaces as the gold light blooms.\n\noverall_soundscape: Water falls in the far valley. Heavy silk banners shift in a slow breeze. Guqin strings speak in spaced dry plucks. When the gold light appears, air shimmers with a brief high ring, then the waterfall continues.\n\nnon_diegetic_music: A solo guzheng line at a slow tempo with long decaying notes; a brighter high-string accent strikes once as the gold light appears, then the quiet low-string drone returns.",
